    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_76929a03",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image shows a man in a suit, likely from a historical or dramatic film, sitting in a chair and smoking, with text overlaid that reads 'i felt a great disturbance in the force' and 'as if a million snowflakes all melted at once.' The scene is a visual reference to the Star Wars character Obi-Wan Kenobi, known for his Jedi powers and the phrase 'I felt a great disturbance in the force.' The text is a humorous, absurd, and self-aware parody of the dramatic tone of Star Wars, using an exaggerated and nonsensical metaphor to describe a minor or trivial event. The overall intent is comedic and satirical, aiming to evoke laughter through the juxtaposition of a serious, cinematic moment with a ridiculous, over-the-top explanation. There is no toxicity, harmful content, or hateful messaging present. The meme is purely for entertainment and does not target any specific group or individual with disparaging or harmful intent. The intent is to create humor through absurdity and pop culture reference.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_724129bd"
