    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_d2ed7723",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The man is mapped as Obi-Wan Kenobi sensing the Force",
      "description": "The visual of the elderly man in a contemplative pose, smoking, is mapped onto the textual phrase 'i felt a great disturbance in the force', which is a famous line from Star Wars spoken by Obi-Wan Kenobi. The visual material (the man) is being used to represent the character Obi-Wan Kenobi in the context of his iconic line, creating an analogical mapping where the man's serious demeanor and setting evoke the dramatic tone of the Star Wars character.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
